<description>WR-USB Type C Connectors

Characteristics
Available in 24p (3.x), 16p (2.0) and 6p (Power Delivery only)
Aligned with Power Delivery up to 240W
High durability (10 000 cycles)
UL, TID listing for USB standards

Applications
Mobile computing and smart devices
High-performance industrial and medical systems
Consumer electronics and multimedia hubs
Smart buildings

Details see: www.we-online.com/en/components/products/INPUT_OUTPUT_WR_USB_STANDARD

Updated by Ella 2026-07-03
2026 (C) Würth Elektronik</description>
